    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe xgrammar backend only received the model config's EOS ids, but the scheduler also finishes on `tokenizer.eos_token_id` and `additional_stop_token_ids`. The grammar treats a stop token it doesn't know about as plain text, so a constrained request could end on that token in the middle of the grammar. For example, Kimi-K3 with `tool_choice=required` ended on `[EOS]` right after its text reply, with no tool call.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n`create_grammar_backend` merges every token the scheduler stops on (config EOS ids, `tokenizer.eos_token_id`, `additional_stop_token_ids`) once and passes that set to every grammar backend: xgrammar, llguidance, outlines and registered custom backends.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\n`test_grammar_stop_token_ids_include_every_scheduler_stop_token` and `test_custom_backend_receives_tokenizer_stop_tokens` fail on `main` and pass with this PR. The other tests in `test_base_grammar_backend.py` give the same results on `main` and with this PR.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nN/A.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\r\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\r\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40997447879](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40997447879)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40997447845](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40997447845)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #40997447885](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40997447885)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
